  "intro": {
    "language": "en",
    "text": "Rafael Mariano Grossi (born 29 January 1961) is an Argentine diplomat. He has been Director General of the International Atomic Energy Agency (IAEA) since 3 December 2019. He was formerly the Argentine ambassador to Austria.",
